{"id": "3003609", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3003609", "title": "Swedish Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu masculin", "text": "Swedish Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu masculin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2023. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la B\u00e5stad, Suedia, disputat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. Rafael Matos \u0219i David Vega Hern\u00e1ndez au fost campionii en-titre, dar Vega Hern\u00e1ndez a ales s\u0103 participe la turneul de la Gstaad. \nGonzalo Escobar \u0219i Aleksandr Nedovyesov au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlu de dublu la Swedish Open 2023, \u00eenving\u00e2nd \u00een final\u0103 perechea Francisco Cabral \u0219i Rafael Matos cu 6\u20132, 6\u20132."}
