{"id": "3003615", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3003615", "title": "Hall of Fame Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Hall of Fame Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2023. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Gstaad, Elve\u021bia, disputat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. William Blumberg \u0219i Steve Johnson au fost campionii en-titre, dar Johnson nu particip\u0103 \u00een acest an. Blumberg a jucat \u00een parteneriat cu Max Purcell dar au fost \u00eenvin\u0219i \u00een final\u0103.\nNathaniel Lammons \u0219i Jackson Withrow au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu la Hall of Fame Open 2023, \u00eenving\u00e2nd \u00een final\u0103 perechea William Blumberg \u0219i Max Purcell cu 6\u20133, 5\u20137, [10\u20135]."}
