{"id": "3004278", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3004278", "title": "Hamburg European Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu masculin", "text": "Hamburg European Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu masculin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2023. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Hamburg, Germania, jucat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103. Lloyd Glasspool \u0219i Harri Heli\u00f6vaara au fost campionii en-titre, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba lui Hugo Dellien \u0219i Guido Pella.\nKevin Krawietz \u0219i Tim P\u00fctz au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu masculin la Hamburg European Open 2023, \u00eenving\u00e2nd perechea Sander Gill\u00e9 \u0219i Joran Vliegen \u00een final\u0103, cu scorul de 7\u20136(7\u20134), 6\u20133."}
