{"id": "3004491", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3004491", "title": "Ladies Open Lausanne 2023 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Ladies Open Lausanne 2023 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2023. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Lausanne, Elve\u021bia, jucat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. Olga Danilovi\u0107 \u0219i Kristina Mladenovic au fost campioanele en-titre, dar au ales s\u0103 nu-\u0219i apere titlul.\nAnna Bond\u00e1r \u0219i Diane Parry au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu feminin la Ladies Open Lausanne 2023, \u00eenving\u00e2nd perechea Amina Anshba \u0219i Anastasia De\u021biuc \u00een final\u0103, cu scorul de 6\u20132, 6\u20131."}
